  "details": "Description\n\nAnytime I go to join a world it is stuck on a loop of telling me my connection timed out and then trying to rejoin the world, there is no option to go back to home so my only option is to close the game and try again. Every world has this problem and I have found no solution.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI've tried every account, every troubleshooting option, I've tried thinking the problem away and no matter what it is not fixed.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Networking\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-15_13-52-09.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_13e9ddf7-27c5-487b-be72-abbd906e50d2/1/file)",
